          "description": "Adds roles/cloudkms.cryptoKeyEncrypter on host-key for the cluster SA. One gcloud command. Then I can run sops updatekeys from shiori with the SA-key pulled from mari, no human touch after. (Encrypt tied to the cluster SA forever; rotating it then becomes a project admin decision.)"
        },
