          "label": "I'll run sops updatekeys on fujiwara",
          "description": "I commit only the .sops.yaml edit and the flake.nix flip, then you run sops updatekeys on fujiwara under the human's ADC. fujiwara + utsuho still verify with their device WIF path, then I commit + push the re-wrapped secrets.yaml from there. Lowest IAM impact but needs a manual step on fujiwara."
