      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Flip together with the .sops.yaml drop",
          "description": "One commit: .sops.yaml drop + flake.nix:159 flip + secrets.yaml rewrap (if you choose option 1 or 2 above). Clean-atomic. Item 4 ships in one go."
        },
        {
          "label": "Flake.nix flip only, leave sops.yaml for a follow-up",
          "description": "darwin path uses WIF but secrets.yaml still has nix-key in its recipient set. Two atomic commits then: (a) flake flip pulled on mari's next darwin-rebuild; (b) secrets rewrap. Risk window: any host rebooted between (a) and (b) fails to decrypt because the file requires host-key but mari's nix-darwin activation is now configured for the WIF path only -- but nix-key is still a recipient so decrypt still succeeds via nix-key."
        },
        {
          "label": "Skip the flake flip entirely",
          "description": "Leave darwinConfigurations.mari.sops.environment with gcp-key.json for now (it still works: nix-key is in recipients). I'll come back to it after fujiwara/utsuho verify the rewrap."
        }
      ],
      "selectionMode": "single"
    }
  ]
}

